+ * only the constant; each forgiveness clause deleted GREEN 10/10 and swallowed a real activation.
+ * Each row runs its clause DELETED IN THE RUN as its negative: the dev server's own
+ * `PlayerMark.vue` module is served with that one assignment cut (the cut must land exactly once),
