+// ── LOBBY_ARIA_ONLY's behavioural twin (SHAPE law iii; the pass-8 critic's gap 8) ─────────────
+// `check-font-coverage.mjs` drops `LOBBY_COPY.plus` from the painted corpus by name, on the claim
+// that its line reaches ONLY the mark's `:aria-label`. A source claim owes its twin on the page: at
+// six and at sixteen people, under the arm the source ships, no text on the page outside an
+// `aria-label` holds a `plus` line (every text node under <body>, every `title`, every ::before /
+// ::after `content`), and under arm (c) the mark's accessible name does. The plant paints the line
+// into the mark in the run, the shape a `{{ markName }}` paint would ship, and the row must SEE it.
